{"id":11,"date":"2024-07-01T07:23:19","date_gmt":"2024-07-01T07:23:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/?page_id=11"},"modified":"2024-11-20T15:18:44","modified_gmt":"2024-11-20T15:18:44","slug":"home","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/","title":{"rendered":"Home"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<div class=\"hero\" data-images=\"4\">\r\n            <div class=\"background-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/GettyImages-158687149-1.png\" class=\"desktop-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/GettyImages-158687149-1.png 1920w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/GettyImages-158687149-1-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/GettyImages-158687149-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/GettyImages-158687149-1-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/GettyImages-158687149-1-1536x864.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"background-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-2.jpeg\" class=\"desktop-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-2.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-2-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-2-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-2-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-2-1536x864.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"background-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-3.jpeg\" class=\"desktop-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-3.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-3-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-3-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-3-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-3-1536x864.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"background-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-4.jpeg\" class=\"desktop-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-4.jpeg 1920w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-4-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-4-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-4-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/hero-4-1536x864.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"mobile-bg-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"406\" height=\"1346\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-1.jpg\" class=\"mobile-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-1.jpg 406w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-1-309x1024.jpg 309w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"mobile-bg-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"406\" height=\"1358\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero2.png\" class=\"mobile-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero2.png 406w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero2-90x300.png 90w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero2-306x1024.png 306w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"mobile-bg-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"406\" height=\"1306\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-3.png\" class=\"mobile-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-3.png 406w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-3-93x300.png 93w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-3-318x1024.png 318w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"mobile-bg-image\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"406\" height=\"1328\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-4.png\" class=\"mobile-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-4.png 406w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-4-92x300.png 92w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-hero-4-313x1024.png 313w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"dots-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/themes\/odyssey\/dist\/images\/dots.png\" alt=\"dots grid\"><\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"heading hero-split-text\"><h1>Transforming the<br \/>\nstandard of care<\/h1>\n<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"under-heading-text hero-split-text\"><p>for patients with autoimmune and inflammatory diseases<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"description hero-split-text\"><p>Odyssey is on a mission to transform the standard of care for patients<br \/>\naffected by autoimmune and inflammatory conditions. We target<br \/>\nupstream signaling nodes and mechanisms like those in the innate<br \/>\nimmune system to prevent pathological inflammation before it occurs.<br \/>\nThis differentiates our approach from the existing standard of care and<br \/>\nunlocks the potential of our therapeutic candidates to induce long-<br \/>\nlasting, deep remission in a safe and effective manner.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn hero-button down\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"13.967\" height=\"24.822\" viewBox=\"0 0 13.967 24.822\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V1.231h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(-8.534 -1.231)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>LET\u2019S DISCOVER<\/span><\/a><\/div>        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div id=\"our-pipeline\" class=\"text-and-image with-split-text our-pipeline\">\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2296\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy.jpg 2296w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy-300x141.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy-1024x482.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy-768x361.jpg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy-1536x723.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/abstract-multi-coloured-twisted-circular-shape-Copy-2048x963.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2296px) 100vw, 2296px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"mobile-background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"375\" height=\"1138\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/gradient-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/gradient-1.jpg 375w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/gradient-1-99x300.jpg 99w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/gradient-1-337x1024.jpg 337w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 375px) 100vw, 375px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"dots-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/themes\/odyssey\/dist\/images\/dots.png\" alt=\"dots grid\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"eyebrow split-text\"><p>New Frontiers of Drug Discovery:<\/p><\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"heading split-text\"><h2>Our<br \/>\nPipeline<\/h2>\n<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"description split-text \"><p>We&#8217;ve built a pipeline of small molecule and protein<br \/>\ntherapeutics that are designed to precisely target<br \/>\ndisease pathology, prioritizing targets where we<br \/>\nbelieve the underlying disease biology is<br \/>\nunderstood, and diseases with significant unmet<br \/>\nneed and large patient populations.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"\/pipeline\" class=\"btn button-delayed line\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"40.814\" height=\"13.967\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.814 13.967\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V-14.761h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(14.761 22.502) rotate(-90)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>SEE OUR PIPELINE<\/span><\/a><\/div>        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div class=\"floating-section with-split-text\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"floating-section-inner\">\r\n                            <div class=\"eyebrow split-text\"><p>Our Pipeline<\/p><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"quote-wrap\">\r\n                <div class=\"quote-text\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"quote split-text\"><p>\u201cWe\u2019re not looking to make an incremental improvement; we\u2019re looking to make something very robust that\u2019s going to fundamentally change a patient\u2019s life. Patient outcomes inform our decisions and inspire innovation.\u201d<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                                                <div class=\"author split-text\"><p>\u2013 Natalie Dales, Ph.D., Chief of Research Operations and Portfolio Strategy<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-image inview-animate--fade\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"520\" height=\"520\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-2@2x.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Natalie Dales\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-2@2x.jpg 520w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-2@2x-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-2@2x-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 520px) 100vw, 520px\" \/><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div id=\"our-approach\" class=\"text-and-image with-split-text our-approach\">\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1672\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-300x196.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-1024x669.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-768x502.jpg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-1536x1003.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/home-img@2x-1-2048x1338.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"mobile-background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"536\" height=\"1073\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-home-img-1-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-home-img-1-1.png 536w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-home-img-1-1-150x300.png 150w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-home-img-1-1-512x1024.png 512w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 536px) 100vw, 536px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"dots-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/themes\/odyssey\/dist\/images\/dots.png\" alt=\"dots grid\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"eyebrow split-text\"><p>Unlocking the Immune System&#8217;s <br>Untapped Potential:<\/p><\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"heading split-text\"><h2>Our<br \/>\nScience<\/h2>\n<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"description split-text no-button\"><p>Therapies targeting initial immune responses have the potential to<br \/>\nprevent pathologic inflammation from initiating versus neutralizing<br \/>\ndownstream inflammatory responses and mediators (akin to stopping<br \/>\na fire from starting versus having to put it out). We believe this<br \/>\napproach differentiates us from current therapies targeting adaptive<br \/>\nimmune responses, which suppress inflammation only after it occurs.<br \/>\nThese current treatment options have produced meaningful benefits to<br \/>\npatients but share fundamental limitations due to cytokine redundancy<br \/>\n\u2014blocking one target cytokine does not prevent others from driving<br \/>\nchronic inflammation.<\/p>\n<p>By focusing on upstream immune responses, our product candidates<br \/>\nhave the potential, whether as monotherapies or in combination, to<br \/>\naddress the issue of downstream cytokine redundancy and mitigate<br \/>\ndirect damage caused by the innate immune response, while having<br \/>\nless immunosuppressive risk.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div class=\"floating-section-2 with-split-text\">\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Repeat-Grid-5.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"dots\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"floating-section-2-inner\">\r\n                            <div class=\"eyebrow split-text\"><p>Our Science<\/p><\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"quote-wrap\">\r\n                <div class=\"quote-text\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"quote split-text\"><p>\u201cWe are unlocking a new approach to targeting inflammatory diseases with the potential to offer new solutions to growing patient populations with unmet needs.\u201d<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                                                <div class=\"author split-text\"><p>\u2013 Jeffrey Hermes, Ph.D., Executive VP, Enabling Sciences<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-image inview-animate--fade\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"520\" height=\"520\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-6@2x.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-6@2x.jpg 520w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-6@2x-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Unknown-6@2x-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 520px) 100vw, 520px\" \/><\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"floating-section-bottom\">\r\n                <div class=\"bottom-image inview-animate--fade\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"398\" height=\"368\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/RC_0128-56v1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"A scientist handling test tubes\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/RC_0128-56v1.jpg 398w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/RC_0128-56v1-300x277.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 398px) 100vw, 398px\" \/><\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"bottom-right-items\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"item with-split-text\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icon line\" style=\"transition-delay:0.03s\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-660.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"text\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-heading split-text\"><p>Discover<\/p><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-description split-text\"><p>We combine a deep understanding of immunobiology, coupled with leading expertise in medicinal, computational and protein chemistry, structural biology, genetics and pharmacology to solve complex therapeutic challenges.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"item with-split-text\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icon line\" style=\"transition-delay:0.33s\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-663.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"text\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-heading split-text\"><p>Develop<\/p><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-description split-text\"><p>Our experienced drug hunters identify novel approaches to treat autoimmune and inflammatory conditions and leverage proprietary tools that accelerate our drug development process.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"item with-split-text\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icon line\" style=\"transition-delay:0.63s\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-556.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"text\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-heading split-text\"><p>Advance<\/p><\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-description split-text\"><p>We act on data and analytics to create efficiencies in the future. This empowers more nimble development as we forge ahead.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"\/our-approach\" class=\"btn button-delayed line\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"40.814\" height=\"13.967\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.814 13.967\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V-14.761h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(14.761 22.502) rotate(-90)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>EXPLORE OUR SCIENCE<\/span><\/a><\/div>                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div id=\"our-leadership\" class=\"text-and-image with-split-text our-leadership\">\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2406\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy.jpg 2406w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy-300x135.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy-1024x460.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy-768x345.jpg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy-1536x689.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-Copy-2048x919.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2406px) 100vw, 2406px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"mobile-background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"393\" height=\"1013\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740.jpg 393w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/mobile-Luigi-Franchi_7X6A2740-116x300.jpg 116w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 393px) 100vw, 393px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"dots-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/themes\/odyssey\/dist\/images\/dots.png\" alt=\"dots grid\"><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"eyebrow split-text\"><p>Experienced Drug Hunters:<\/p><\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"heading split-text\"><h2>Our<br \/>\nLeadership<\/h2>\n<\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"description split-text \"><p>Leading pharmaceutical and biotech experts bring a unique<br \/>\nunderstanding of immune drug discovery, development and<br \/>\ncommercialization to Odyssey. Backed by a management team and<br \/>\nboard with deep experience in identifying, developing and<br \/>\ncommercializing medicines, our leadership is dedicated to advancing<br \/>\nour mission to transform the standard of care for patients with<br \/>\nautoimmune and inflammatory diseases.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"\/leadership\" class=\"btn button-delayed line\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"40.814\" height=\"13.967\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.814 13.967\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V-14.761h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(14.761 22.502) rotate(-90)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>MEET OUR LEADERSHIP<\/span><\/a><\/div>        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div class=\"our-news with-split-text\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n                    <div class=\"eyebrow split-text\"><p>The Ongoing Search:<\/p><\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"heading split-text\"><h2>Our<br \/>\nNews<\/h2>\n<\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"news-list\">\r\n                        <div class=\"post-wrap\">\r\n                    <div class=\"container\">\r\n                        <a href=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/odyssey-therapeutics-and-terray-therapeutics-enter-strategic-collaboration-to-jointly-discover-and-develop-first-in-cl